<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
engines, commercial and general aviation, and ships in the FIP 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
areas only. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
Finally, the FIP proposes two light duty vehicle measures in 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
only the FIP areas of California, namely motor vehicle inspection and maintenance 
<!-- PJG 0034 unknown -->
(I/M), and parking cash out (a transportation 
