<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
technology measures proposed for the South Coast apply only in 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
the South Coast as specified in section 182(e)(5) of the Act. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
Some or all regulations from the other three categories, however, 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
are proposed for implementation in all three FIP areas. These 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
are summarized briefly below. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(1) Regulations for specific source categories. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
Sections III.C.3.b&hyph;p of this NPRM describe eighteen rules 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
