<TEXT>
 
<!-- PJG STAG 4702 -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
As a result, without further SIP or FIP measures, the total 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
amount of emissions in the Sacramento area is not expected to 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
change significantly by 1999 or 2005. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
CARB and EPA have performed extensive meteorologic analysis 
