<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
Amendments of 1990 to demonstrate attainment by 1999. There are 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
several reasons why a 1999 attainment target for a FIP, however, 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
would result in an unreasonable plan with undesirable impacts on 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
the local economy. The following discussion outlines these 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
reasons and explains EPA's proposed solution (i.e., bumping up 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
