<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
The proposed rule is based largely on SCAQMD Rule 1121, 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
BAAQMD Regulation 9_Rule 6, and VCAPCD Rule 74.11. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
Evaluation of the environmental, economic, and other impacts 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
of the proposed rule are discussed in detail in EPA's technical 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
support document. The proposed rule is expected to result in a 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
cost savings created by the more energy efficient units and lower 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
cost of the low-NO
