grow to 2.3 tpd in 1999 and to 2.7 tpd in 2005. Implementation 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
of this proposed rule is projected to reduce those emissions by 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
0.2 and 0.6 tpd respectively at a retail cost savings of $3.00 to 
