<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
(5) Relationship to FIFRA.
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
 EPA acknowledges the unique situation in which the proposed FIP rule places the pesticide and agriculture industries,
which are already subject to considerable regulation under FIFRA. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

