apply only to that rule. The applicability section specifies the 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
area to which the rule applies, who is subject to the rule, and 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
references the sections and/or paragraphs of the rule to which 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
subject persons must comply. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
The specific provisions section of the rules specifies 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
applicable VOC or NO
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=5 f=2 -->
X
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
 limitations and requires subject persons to 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
submit baseline VOC or NO
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

