at least a 20 percent VOC reduction and at least a 30 percent NO
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=5 f=2 -->
X
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
reduction overall. It is expected that subject facilities would 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
continue to maintain VOC and NO
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=5 f=2 -->
X
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
 levels at 2005 levels after 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
2005.
<FOOTCITE>65</FOOTCITE>
 EPA may reduce the annual percent reduction requirement 
