<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
The purpose of the reporting, recordkeeping, testing, and 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
monitoring requirements of the proposed rules is to complement 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
the compliance plan and to ensure their enforceability. The 
