These limits could be expressed in pounds per gallon (grams/liter), weight percent, or volume percent of VOC. EPA
seeks comment for a preferred means of expressing these limits.
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->
