comment on the appropriateness of the duration of these compliance periods. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
EPA is also soliciting comments on establishing a single VOC content limit for all industrial and commercial solvents
and coatings, which would be the level that a manufacturer's sales weighted average must be less than or equal to in
