<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
regulatory program, it is necessary to first project an 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
unregulated baseline into the future. EPA used two sources to 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
estimate baseline locomotive emissions without FIP controls: 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
