<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
Previous analysis of the episodes was used to establish ``across-the-board'' reduction targets of 40 percent VOC
and 40 percent NO
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

