X
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
 from a 1987 emissions baseline in order to attain the ozone standard. This translates to emission targets of 57 tpd
VOC and 46 tpd NO
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=5 f=2 -->
X
