<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
emissions, and does not cover CO emissions. California is 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
projected to be in attainment with the NAAQS for CO by 2000 as 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
required by the Clean Air Act, before the enhanced in-use 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
compliance program would have had a chance to achieve any 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
significant CO emissions reductions. In addition, the FIP 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
addresses only ozone non-attainment and thus focuses only on 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
ozone precursors, NMHC and NO
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=5 f=2 -->
X
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
. 
