<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
during the inspection. If the vehicle passes the pressure/purge 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
check, the evaporative emissions system is assumed to be 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
functioning properly. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

