 in tons for a vehicle in any given category. Adding each column and dividing by the number of vehicles in that class will
yield the fleet's average per-vehicle NO
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=5 f=2 -->
X
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
 emissions for the fleet owner's heavy-duty vehicles. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<TABLE>

<!-- PJG tableformat 3,L2,i1,s50,15,15 -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

