<!-- PJG STAG 4702 -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
The numbers in the table above (and the similar numbers 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
contained in the regulations for the other classes of nonroad 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
equipment) reflect usage patterns for nonroad engines as 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
described in EPA's draft Regulatory Support Document for the 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
national nonroad rule. They reflect typical annual hours of use 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
and load for each equipment type and applicable emissions 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
