<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
EPA commits to publish rules to control VOC emissions from the sources described in paragraph (b) of this section according
to the following schedule: 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

