<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
 emissions sources shall constitute the control categories. The categories are further defined in &sect;52.2955.
Facilities which emit greater than or equal to 4 tons per year of NO
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

