X
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
 from any of the following processes or combination of these processes are affected: 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(1) Boilers, heaters, furnaces, ovens, dryers, incinerators, test cells, and any solid, liquid or gaseous fueled
equipment with a maximum rated capacity: 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(i) Greater than or equal to 40 but less than 500 million Btu per hour and an annual heat input greater than 90 billion
Btu per year; 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
