<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
 of this section will yield inaccurate results and that the proposed adaptation is appropriate.
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(C) 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
Calculations.
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
 Calculations for determining the VOC content, water content, and the content of any compounds which are specifically
exempted from the definition of VOC of coatings, inks, and fountain solutions as applied shall follow the guidance
provided in the following documents.
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
(1)
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
 ``A Guide for Surface Coating Calculation'' EPA&hyph;340/1&hyph;86&hyph;016 (which is available from the National
Technical Information Services, 5285 Port Royal Road, Springfield, Virginia, 22161) 
