<TEXT>
 
<!-- PJG STAG 4702 -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
Commercial baking facility
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
 means a facility that bakes bread, biscuits, rolls, pies, cakes, cookies, or other similar products. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
Commercial charbroiling facility
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
 means a facility that broils any type of food over a charcoal or gas-fired broiler. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
Food preparation facility
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
 means any commercial baking, commercial charbroiling, wine- or brandy-making, fruit and vegetable preservation,
grain mill production, vegetable oil production, or malt beverage production facility. This definition includes
restaurants involved in activities described in the previous sentence. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
Fruit and vegetable preservation facility
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
 means a facility that preserves food by, but not limited to, canning, curing, pickling, salting, smoking, cooking,
or freezing. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
Grain mill production facility
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
 means a facility that grinds any grain including, but not limited to, wheat, rice, corn, or rye into flour or meal. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
Malt beverage production facility
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
 means a facility engaged in malting, fermentation, aging, or packaging of barley or any other grain for the purpose
of producing an alcoholic beverage. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
Vegetable oil production facility
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
 means a facility that extracts oil from any vegetable seed. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
Wine- or brandy-making facility
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
 means a facility that ferments juices from grapes or any other fruit for the purpose of producing alcoholic beverages.

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(ii) 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
Applicability. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(A) The requirements of paragraphs (b)(4) (iii)(A) and (iii)(B), (iv)(A), (v)(A), and (vi)(A) of this section shall
apply to any owner or operator of a commercial food preparation facility located in the control area as defined in paragraph
(a)(1) of this section at which VOC emissions are greater than or equal to 4.5 kg (10 lbs) during any one day. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(B) The requirements of paragraphs (b)(4) (iv)(B), (v)(B), and (vi)(B) of this section shall apply to any owner or
operator of a commercial food preparation facility located in the applicable area specified in paragraph (b)(4)(ii)(A)
of this section at which total uncontrolled VOC emissions from all emissions sources are always less than 4.5 kg (10
lbs) during any one day. If VOC emissions from a facility which is exempt from the limitations of paragraph (b)(4)(iii)(B)
of this section ever exceed 4.5 kg (10 lbs) during any one day on or after January 1, 2000, the facility will lose its exempt
status, and the owner or operator shall comply with the requirements of paragraphs (b)(4) (iii)(B), (iv)(A), (v)(A),
and (vi)(A) of this section beginning January 1 of the calendar year following the date of the exceedance. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(iii) Specific Provisions. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(A) Each owner or operator of a source subject to the FIP VOC emissions cap program as defined in paragraph (b)(1)(ii)
of this section shall submit a VOC emissions reduction compliance plan to the Administrator by January 1, 1999. The
plan shall be prepared for the years 2001 through 2005 and shall include all of the information specified in paragraphs
(b)(1)(iii)(A) (1)
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
 through 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
(5)
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
 of this section. Each owner or operator shall submit a revised plan to the Administrator within 30 calendar days of
receipt of comments from the Administrator. Each owner or operator shall comply at all times with the provisions of
the most recent plan approved by the Administrator. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
(1)
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
 The name, title, address, and telephone number of the owner or operator of the facility, and of each person responsible
for preparing the information required under paragraph (b)(1)(iii)(A)
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
(2)
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
 of this section. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
(2)
