<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(i) Definitions. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(A) For the purpose of paragraph (b)(4) of this section, the general definitions in paragraph (a)(3) of this section
apply. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(B) For the purpose of paragraph (b)(4) of this section, the following definitions also apply: 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
Brandy-making facility 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
