Petroleum and Natural Gas Extraction, Processing, and Storage. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(i) Definitions. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(A) For the purpose of paragraph (b)(5) of this section, the general definitions in paragraph (a)(3) of this section
apply. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(B) For the purpose of paragraph (b)(5) of this section, the following definitions also apply: 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
Crude oil
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
 means a naturally occurring mixture which consists of hydrocarbons and sulfur, nitrogen, or oxygen derivatives
of hydrocarbons and which is a liquid at standard conditions. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
Extraction facility 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
means any facility where drilling and servicing equipment, flow lines, separators, gathering lines, and auxiliary
nontransportation related equipment are used to extract petroleum or natural gas from a well. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
Gasoline
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
 means any petroleum distillate which is used as a motor fuel. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
Petroleum
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
 means the crude oil removed from the earth and the oils derived from tar sands, shale, and coal. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
Processing facility
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
 means any facility where petroleum or natural gas is used as a feedstock to produce gasoline, kerosene, distillate
fuel oils, residual fuel oils, lubricants, or other related products. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG /STAG -->
