<!-- PJG STAG 4702 -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
(i) Inspections. All sources and facilities subject to provisions of this section shall be subject to unannounced
inspections by representatives of the USEPA pursuant to section 114 of the Clean Air Act. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(ii) Information requests. Documentation maintained by all sources, facilities, and persons subject to this section
must be sufficient to demonstrate compliance with all requirements of this section and must be provided to representatives
of USEPA in response to information requests pursuant to section 114 of the Clean Air Act. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(iii) Failure to comply with any provision of this section is a violation of the applicable implementation plan for
purposes of section 113 of the Clean Air Act. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(iv) Each 50 pounds of emissions in excess of a facility's monthly cap shall be a separate violation for federal enforcement
purposes. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(b) Stationary and area source control measures. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(1) NO
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=5 f=2 -->
X
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
 emission sources. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(i) 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
Definitions. 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
For purposes of this section, the general definitions in paragraph (a)(3) of this section apply. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(ii) 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
Applicability. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(A) The requirements of paragraphs (b)(1), (iii)(A), (iii)(B), (iv)(A), (v)(A), and (vi)(A) of this section shall
apply to any owner or operator of any of the following equipment at a facility located in the control area as defined
in paragraph (a)(1) of this section: 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(1) 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
Any boiler, furnace, oven, dryer, heater, incinerator, test cell and any solid, liquid or gaseous fueled equipment
with a maximum rated capacity greater than or equal to 2 million Btu per hour; 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
(2) 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
Any internal combustion engine with rated brake horsepower (bhp) greater than or equal to 50 bhp, regardless of operating
time; 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
(3) 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
Any gas turbine rated greater than or equal to 0.2 megawatts excluding any emergency standby equipment or peaking
unit; 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
(4) 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
Any petroleum refinery fluid catalytic cracking unit; 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
(5) 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
Any petroleum refinery tail gas unit; 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
(6) 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
Any kiln or calciner; 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
(7) 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
Any equipment burning or incinerating solid fuels or materials; 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
(8) 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
Any sulfuric acid production unit; 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
(9) 
