design, delivery systems or other factors, the use of the product will result in less VOC emissions as compared to:

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(A) The VOC emissions from a representative consumer product which complies with the VOC standards specified in paragraph
(a)(3)(i) of this section, or 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(B) The calculated VOC emissions from a noncomplying representative product, if the product had been reformulated
to comply with the VOC standards specified in paragraph (a)(3)(i) of this section. VOC emissions shall be calculated
using the following equation: 
