and I&amp;I products must register products that are sold in California during the calendar year prior to the year
the registration is due: products for which a VOC standard is specified in paragraph (a)(3)(i) of this section; products
approved as an innovative product under paragraph (a)(5) of this section; and products claiming exemptions under
paragraphs (a)(4)(vi), (a)(4)(vii), (a)(4)(viii) of this section. All registrations shall include the following
information: 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(A) The name of the responsible party and the party's address, telephone number, and designated contact person; 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(B) Any claim of confidentiality made pursuant to 40 CFR part 2, subpart B; 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(C) The product brand name for each consumer product subject to registration and upon request by the Administrator,
the product label; 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

