<!-- PJG STAG 4702 -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
Slip-resistant coating
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
 means a coating labeled exclusively as such which is formulated with synthetic grit, and used as a safety coating.

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
Spatter coating/multicolor coating
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
 means a coating labeled exclusively as such wherein spots, globules, or spatters of contrasting colors appear on
or within the surface of a contrasting or similar background. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
Stain
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
 means a coating which is formulated to change the color of a surface but not conceal the surface. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
Vinyl/fabric/polycarbonate coating
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
 means a coating labeled exclusively as such, which is used to coat vinyl, fabric, or polycarbonate substrates. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
Volatile organic compound (VOC)
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
 means any compound of carbon, excluding carbon monoxide, carbon dioxide, carbonic acid, metallic carbides or carbonates,
and ammonium carbonate, which participates in atmospheric photochemical reactions other than those defined as
exempt compounds. These exempt compounds have been determined to have negligible photochemical reactivity. For
purposes of determining compliance with emission limits, VOC will be measured by test methods given in this section.
Where such a method also measures compounds with negligible photochemical reactivity, an owner or operator may exclude
these negligibly reactive compounds when determining compliance with an emission standard. However, the U.S. EPA
may require such owner or operator, as a precondition to excluding these compounds for purposes of determining compliance,
to provide monitoring methods and monitoring results demonstrating, to the satisfaction of the U.S. EPA, the amount
of negligibly reactive compounds in the source's emissions. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
Webbing/veiling coating
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
 means a coating labeled exclusively as such, which is formulated to give a stranded to spider webbed appearance when
applied. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
Weld-through primer
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
 means a coating formulated and labeled exclusively as such which provides a bridging or conducting effect to provide
corrosion protection following welding. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
Wood stain
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
 means a coating which is formulated to change the color of a wood surface but not conceal the surface. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
Wood touch-up/repair/restoration
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
 means a coating formulated and labeled exclusively as such which provides an exact color or sheen match on finished
wood products. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(c) 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
Standards
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(1) Except as provided in paragraphs (d) and (g) of this section, no person shall sell, supply, offer for sale, apply,
or manufacture for sale in California, any aerosol coating product which, at the time of sale, use, or manufacture,
contains volatile organic compounds in excess of the limits specified in the following Table of Standards after the
specified effective dates. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG /STAG -->
</TEXT>
