<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
Bright metal trim repair coating 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
means a coating applied 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
directly to chrome-plated metal surfaces for the purpose of 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
appearance. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
Bus 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
means any motor vehicle having a manufacturer's gross 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
vehicle weight of more than 8,600 pounds, which is designed 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
primarily for the transportation of persons and has a design 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
capacity of over 12 persons. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
Clearcoat 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
means a topcoat which contains no pigments or only 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
transparent pigments and which is the final topcoat applied as a 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
part of a multistage topcoat system. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
Coating 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
means a material which is applied to a surface and 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
which forms a film in order to beautify and/or protect such 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
surface. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
Elastomeric materials 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
mean coatings which are specifically 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
formulated and applied over coated or uncoated flexible plastic 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
substrates for the purpose of adhesion. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
Electrostatic application 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
means charging of atomized paint 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
droplets for deposition by electrostatic attraction. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
Enamel 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
means a coating that cures by chemical cross-linking 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
of its base resin. Enamels can be readily distinguished from 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
lacquers because enamels are not resoluble in their original 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
solvent. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
Extreme-performance topcoat 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
means a topcoat used on the 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
surface of Group II vehicles and mobile equipment, and which 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
qualifies under the provisions of paragraph (c)(6)(vii) of this 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
section. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
General topcoat 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
means any type of topcoat except 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
extreme-performance topcoat, metallic topcoat, and any topcoat 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
applied as part of a multistage topcoat system. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

