<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
Floor covering installation
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
 means the installation of wood 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
flooring, indoor carpet, outdoor carpet, resilient tile, cove 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
base, or artificial grass, using an adhesive formulated for that 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
purpose. Ceramic tile is excluded from this category. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

