<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
8.5, &sect;&sect;94507&hyph;94517, of the California Code of Regulations. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
Multipurpose architectural adhesive
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
 means any adhesive that 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
is intended by the manufacturer to be applied for the 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
installation, manufacture, or repair of various construction 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
materials to bond architectural structures or appurtenances, 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
including but not limited to drywall, subfloor, panel deck and 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
lumber, seams, fiberglass reinforced plastic, ceiling tile and 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
acoustical tile. Adhesives used to bond uninstalled cabinets, 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
counters and other architectural appurtenances are subject to 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
this adhesive category. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
Nonmembrane roof installation/maintenance
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
 means any product 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
that is intended for the installation or repair of roofs and that 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
is not intended for the installation of prefabricated single-ply 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
flexible roofing membrane. This category includes plastic or 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
asphalt roof cement, asphalt roof coatings, or cold application 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
cement. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
Organic compound
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
 means a chemical compound of carbon 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
excluding carbon monoxide, carbon dioxide, carbonic acid, 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
metallic carbides or carbonates, and ammonium carbonate. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
Panel installation
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
 means the installation of plywood, 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
pre-decorated hardboard (or tileboard), fiberglass, reinforced 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
plastic, and similar pre-decorated or non-decorated panels to 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
studs or solid surfaces using an adhesive formulated for that 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
purpose. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

