<!-- PJG STAG 4702 -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=4 -->
(ii) 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
Aerosol spray products
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
. A person shall not use any 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
adhesive aerosol spray unless the VOC content, including the 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
propellant, does not exceed 25 percent by weight. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(iii) 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
Cleanup solvents
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
. Solvents used for surface 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
preparation, equipment cleanup, and thinning operations, 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
including storage and disposal of VOC-containing materials, shall 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
be subject to the provisions and requirements of &sect;52.2961(a). 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(iv) 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
Emission control system
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
. A person may comply with the 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
provisions of paragraph (d)(3)(i) of this section by using an 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
emission control system, provided that this system maintains a 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
control efficiency (capture efficiency times destruction or 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
removal efficiency) of the VOC emissions of at least 85 (eighty- 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
five) percent by weight. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(v) 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
Prohibition of sales
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(A) Except as provided in paragraphs (d)(3)(v)(C) through (E) is this section, no person shall supply, sell, or offer

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
for sale any non-complying adhesive, sealant, or adhesive 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
primer which, at the time of sale, is defined under a 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
product category in the table of VOC limits of this section 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
after the specified effective dates. This provision only 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
applies to products that are supplied to or sold within the 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
affected area. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(B) Except as provided in paragraphs (d)(3)(v)(C) or 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(E) of this section, no person shall supply, sell, or offer 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
for sale, any adhesive aerosol which, at the time of sale, 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
exceed the VOC limits listed in paragraph (d)(3)(ii) of this 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
section after the specified effective dates. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(C) The sales prohibition in paragraphs (d)(3)(v) (A) 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
and (B) of this section shall not apply to any supplier or 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
seller of any adhesive, sealant, or adhesive primer as 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
follows: 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
1
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
) Any adhesive shipped outside of the affected 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
area for use outside of the affected area. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
2
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
) The sale of adhesives to a person controlling 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
the emissions from use of those adhesives by using an 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
emission control system pursuant to paragraph 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(d)(3)(iv) of this section. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(D) The sales prohibition in paragraphs (d)(3)(v) (A) 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
and (B) of this section shall not apply to the sale of any 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
adhesive, sealant, or adhesive primer, except plastic cement 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
welding adhesives or primers, if the product is sold in any 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
container(s) having a capacity of 16 ounces or less (net 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
volume) or 1 pound or less (net weight). The total weight 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
or volume of two or more containers packaged together must 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
be less than 1 pound (16 ounces) to qualify for this 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
exemption. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(E) The sales prohibitions in paragraphs (d)(3)(v) (A) 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
and (B) of this section shall not apply to any manufacture 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
of any adhesive, sealant, or primer if the manufacturer has 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
provided an accurate compliance statement and if: 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
1
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
) The product was not sold directly to a user 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
or a sales outlet located in the affected area, or 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
2
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
) The product was sold to an independent 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
distributor that is not a subsidiary, or under the 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
direct control of, the manufacturer. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(vi) 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
Compliance statement requirement
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
. The manufacturer of 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
any adhesive, sealant, or adhesive primer subject to this 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
determination shall include a designation of maximum VOC content 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
as supplied, including adhesive components, expressed in grams 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
per liter of adhesive (or pounds per gallon) excluding water and 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
exempt compounds (percent by weight for adhesive aerosols) from 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
the appropriate test method, on labels or data sheets. This 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
designation shall include recommendations regarding thinning, 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
reducing, or mixing with any other VOC-containing material. This 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
statement shall include the maximum VOC on an as-applied basis 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
when used in accordance with the manufacturer's recommendations. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(vii) 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
Prohibition of specification
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
. No person shall 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
solicit, require for use, or specify the application of any 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
adhesive, primer, or sealant if such use or application results 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
in a violation of the provisions of this section. This 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
prohibition shall apply to all written or oral contracts. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(4) 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
Exemptions
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(i) The provisions of paragraphs (d)(3)(i) and (ii) of this 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
section shall not apply to the following: 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(A) Adhesives used in tire repair, provided the label 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
on the adhesive used states: 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=84 g=1 f=1 -->
For Tire Repair Only
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
(B) Assembly and manufacturing of undersea-based 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
weapon systems. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(C) Testing and evaluation of adhesive or sealant 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
products in any research and development, quality assurance, 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
or analytical laboratories, provided that: 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
1
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
) A record is kept of: 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
i
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
) The date when the adhesives, sealants, 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
or adhesive primers are used, and the type of 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
applications(s); and 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG /STAG -->
</TEXT>
