<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
(ii) 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
Emission control system.
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
 Owners and/or operators may comply with paragraph (e)(3)(i) of this section by using an emission control system,
provided that the VOC emissions from such operations and/or materials are reduced in accordance with the following
provisions: 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(A) The control device shall maintain a destruction or removal efficiency of the emissions from an emission collection
system of at least 95 (ninety-five) percent, by weight; and 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(B) The emission collection system which collects and transports emissions to the air pollution control device(s)
shall maintain a capture efficiency of at least 90 (ninety) percent, by weight, of the emissions generated by the sources
of emissions. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(iii) 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
