<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(F) If the volume of gas collected in any quarter is less than 90% of the target volume established for that quarter,
the owner shall be in violation of this section and shall re-establish baseline conditions pursuant to paragraph
(g)(3)(i)(B) of this section within the first two weeks of the following quarter. 
