<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(G) Notwithstanding the requirements of paragraph (g)(3)(i)(F) of this section, the owner of any active landfill
shall re-establish baseline conditions pursuant to paragraph (g)(3)(i)(B) of this section at least once every six
