<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(F) All records of perimeter well testing. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(G) Where an owner subject to the provisions of this 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
paragraph seeks to demonstrate compliance with paragraph 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(g)(3)(i)(H) of this section: 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
(1)
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
 The calculated maximum expected gas generation 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
flowrate using the method described in paragraph 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(g)(3)(i)(H)(
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
1
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
) of this section. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
(2)
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
 The calculated area of influence of the extraction 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
wells. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
(3)
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
 Gauge pressure in the gas collection header at the 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
point where each well is connected to the gas collection 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
header pipe. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(H) Where an owner subject to the provisions of this 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
paragraph seeks to demonstrate compliance through use of an 
