performance testing. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(J) Where an owner subject to the provisions of this 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
paragraph seeks to demonstrate compliance through use of an open 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
flare, the flare type (i.e., steam-assisted, air-assisted, or 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
nonassisted), all visible emission readings, heat content 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
determination, flowrate measurements, and exit velocity 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
determinations made during the performance test, continuous 
