<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(E) The calculations contained in &sect;60.45(f)(5) and &sect;60.46b(f). 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(h) Emissions from Livestock Waste. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(1) 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
Applicability.
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
 On or after January 1, 1998, any owner or operator of a dairy cattle operation shall comply with the requirements of
paragraphs (h)(1) through (h)(6) of this section. For the purposes of this paragraph, the affected areas include
the Sacramento Metro Area, the Los Angeles-South Coast Air Basin Area, and the Ventura County Area as described for
ozone in 40 CFR 81.305. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(2) 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
Definitions.
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
 For the purposes of paragraph (h) of this section, the following definitions shall apply. All terms not defined herein
shall have the meaning given them in &sect;52.2950. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
Covered lagoon
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
 means a holding pond with a floating impermeable cover that effectively captures volatile organic compound and methane
emissions, recovers them through a collection device and uses the methane for on-farm heating or cooling, electricity
generation, or other end use technology. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
Dairy cattle
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
 mean cows and calves managed as a dairy cattle operation. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
Dairy cattle operation
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
 means any facility managing greater than 400 cows for the purpose of producing milk or milk products. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
Digester
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
 means an enclosed non-pressurized vessel in which influent is managed to maximize the generation of methane for utilization
in on-farm heating or cooling or electricity generation. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
End use technology
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
 means the equipment powered by recovered methane gas and its use. Examples of end use technologies are internal combustion
engines for generating electricity, boiler and space heaters to produce heat for various operations, and gas-fired
chillers to be used for refrigeration. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
Influent
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
 means manure-containing liquid from the feed apron and milk parlor areas of a dairy cattle operation, which flows
to a covered lagoon or digester. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
Livestock waste
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
 means livestock excrement including liquid wastes, fecal material, and decomposing manure. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
Recovery system
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
 means a covered lagoon or digester. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
Stockpile
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
 is manure that is temporarily stored at a designated location prior to shipment for handling at another on-site or
off-site location. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(3) 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
Specific Provisions. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(i) Dairy cattle operations shall install a recovery 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
system, such as a covered lagoon or digester, to collect and 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
recover livestock waste influent. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG /STAG -->
</TEXT>
