<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
Additional Requirements. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(A) An owner/operator shall not offer for sale, sell, or 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
install any new or rebuilt vapor recovery equipment unless the 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
components and the parts are clearly identified or marked by the 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
certified manufacturing company and/or the certified rebuilding 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
company. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(B) An owner/operator shall not perform or permit the 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
``pump-out'' (bulk transfer) of gasoline from a storage tank 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
subject to paragraph (j)(3)(i) of this section; unless such bulk 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
transfer is performed using a vapor collection and transfer 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
system capable of returning the displaced vapors to the 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
stationary storage tank or unless the storage tank will be 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
removed or filled with water for testing. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(C) An owner/operator shall not store, or allow the storage 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
of, gasoline in any stationary storage tank with a capacity of 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
950 liters (251 gallons) or more unless such tank is equipped 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
with a Phase I vapor recovery system. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(D) An owner/operator of any gasoline dispensing facility 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
shall conspicuously post the following signs in the immediate 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
gasoline dispensing area. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(1
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
) ``NOZZLE'' operating instructions; 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
2
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
) Appropriate District toll-free telephone number; and 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
3
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
) A warning sign stating: 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=85 g=1 f=1 -->
Toxic Risk_For Your Own Protection Do Not Breathe Fumes. Do Not Top Tanks
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
(E) All required signs shall conform to all of the 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
following: 
