(
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
i
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
) Each sign shall be located adjacent to the 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
dispenser price indicator (per gallon) on each side 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
next to the driveway it serves; and 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
ii
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
) Sign shall be readable from a distance of 3 feet 
