portion of the local air district that falls within the 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
boundaries of the Sacramento FIP area; 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(ii) Predicted meteorology including wind speed, and mixing 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
height; and 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(iii) Forecast temperature. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(4) 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
Permitting
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
. Agricultural burning is prohibited unless 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
a valid burn permit is obtained from the appropriate designated 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
agency. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(5) 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
Restrictions
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(i) Agricultural burning shall be prohibited on a no-burn 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
day. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(ii) Open burning shall be prohibited on a no-burn day. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(6) 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
Exemptions
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
. [Reserved]. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(l) 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
Emissions of Oxides of Nitrogen from Natural Gas-fired 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
Water Heaters
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(1) 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
Applicability
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
. For the purposes of paragraph (l) of 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
this section, the affected area includes the Sacramento Metro 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
Area as described for ozone in 40 CFR 81.305. The requirements 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
of paragraphs (l)(1) through (6) of this section shall apply 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
to any person who manufactures, offers for sale, sells, or 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
installs any natural gas-fired water heater with a rated heat 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
input capacity less than 75,000 British thermal units per hour 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(Btu/hr). 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(2) 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
Definitions
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
. For the purposes of paragraph (l) of this 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
section, the following definitions shall apply. All terms not 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
defined herein shall have the meaning given them in &sect;52.2950. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
British thermal unit (Btu)
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
 means the amount of heat required 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
to raise the temperature of one pound of water from 59
<!-- PJG 0017 degreeslatlong -->
&cir;F to 60
<!-- PJG 0017 degreeslatlong -->
&cir;F 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
at one atmosphere.
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
Heat input
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
 means the actual amount of heat released by 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
natural gas burned in a water heater. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
Heat output
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
 means the product obtained by multiplying the 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
recovery efficiency, as defined by Title 20, California 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
Administrative Code, Chapter 2, Subchapter 4, Article 4, Sections 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
1603 and 1607, by the heating value of the natural gas furnished 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
to the water heater. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
Natural gas
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
 means a mixture of gaseous hydrocarbons 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
containing at least 80 percent methane by volume as determined 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
according to American Standard Test Method (ASTM) D1945&hyph;64. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
Rated heat input capacity
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
 means the heat input capacity 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
specified on the nameplate of the combustion unit. If the 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
combustion unit has been altered or modified such that its 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
maximum heat input is different than the heat input capacity 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
specified on the nameplate, the new maximum heat input shall be 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
considered as the rated heat input capacity. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
Water heater
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
 means a device that heats water at a 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
thermostatically-controlled temperature for delivery on demand. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(3) 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
Standards
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
. After May 31, 1995, no person shall 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
manufacturer, offer for sale, sell, or install any natural gas-
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
fired water heater with NO
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=5 f=2 -->
X
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
 emissions in excess of 40 nanograms 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
calculated as weight equivalent NO
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=5 f=2 -->
X
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
 per joule (ng/j) [93 pounds 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
per billion Btu (93 lb/10
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=5 f=1 -->
9
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
 Btu)] of heat output. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(4) 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
Exemptions
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
. The provisions of this section shall not 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
apply to: 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(i) Water heaters with a rated heat input of 75,000 Btu/hr 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
or greater. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(ii) Water heaters used in recreational vehicles. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(iii) Water heaters used exclusively to heat swimming pools 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
and hot tubs. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(5) 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
Reporting and Recordkeeping
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(i) 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
Compliance Report
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
. A manufacturer shall submit to the 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
Administrator a Compliance Report which demonstrates that each 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
water heater model complies with the section. A manufacturer 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
shall submit a new Compliance Report for any water heater model 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
whose design is changed in any manner which may alter NO
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=5 f=2 -->
X
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
emissions. Compliance Reports, for either new models or altered 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
models, shall be submitted to the Administrator at least 30 days 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
before the water heater model is offered for sale, sold, or 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
installed in the control area. The Compliance Report shall 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
contain the following information: 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(A) 
