(1) 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
Applicability
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
. For the purposes of this paragraph, the 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
affected area includes the Sacramento Metro Area as described for 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
ozone in 40 CFR 81.305. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(i) Any owner or operator of a stationary internal 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
combustion engine rated at equal to or greater than 50 brake 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
horsepower shall comply with the applicable requirements of 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
paragraphs (m)(1) through (m)(7) of this section. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(ii) Any owner or operator of a stationary internal 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
combustion engine that claims an exemption from the standards of 
