this section shall establish a controlled ppmv VOC emission 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
limit. No owner or operator shall cause to be discharged into 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
the atmosphere any gases that contain VOC in excess of the lowest 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
of one of the following limits: 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(A) 120 percent of the VOC ppmv level established by an 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
initial compliance test in accordance with the requirements of 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
paragraph (m)(7) of this section; or 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(B) 350 ppmv. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
The owner or operator shall subsequently comply with the limit 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
once it is established. The ppmv VOC emissions shall be 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
corrected to 15 percent volume stack gas O
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=5 f=2 -->
2
