<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
layer of phenolic or melamine resin is applied by dipping a 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
continuous moving paper substrate into the resin and then using 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
rollers to squeeze the excess resin from the paper. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

