<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
section by using an emission control system, provided that the 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
overall efficiency of the system (capture efficiency multiplied 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
by destruction efficiency) shall not be less than 85% by weight 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
