<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
well as the operation and maintenance plan necessary to ensure 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
compliance on an ongoing basis, shall be approved in writing by 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
the Executive Officer. 
