<TEXT>
 
<!-- PJG STAG 4702 -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
(
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
1
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
) 120 percent of the CO ppm level established by an initial compliance test in accordance with the requirements of paragraph
(u)(7) of this section, or
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
2
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
) 400 ppm. The owner or operator shall subsequently comply with the limit once it is established. The ppm CO emissions
shall be corrected to 3 percent volume stack gas O
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=5 f=2 -->
2
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
 on a dry basis averaged over a period of 15 consecutive minutes.
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(C) Demonstrate initial compliance with the NO
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=5 f=2 -->
X
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
 and CO emission standards specified in paragraphs (u)(3)(i) (A) and (B) of this section in accordance with the requirements
of paragraphs (u)(6)(i)(C) and (u)(7)(i) of this section.
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(D) Units with a rated heat input capacity equal to or greater than 5 mmBtu/hr and less than 40 mmBtu/hr shall demonstrate
compliance with the NO
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=5 f=2 -->
X
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
 and CO emission standards specified in paragraphs (u)(3)(i) (A) and (B) of this section in accordance with the requirements
of paragraph (u)(7)(i) of this section not less than once every 24 months since the previous compliance test.
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(E) Units with a rated heat input capacity greater than 40 mmBtu/hr and less than 100 mmBtu/hr shall demonstrate compliance
with the NO
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=5 f=2 -->
X
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
 and CO emission standards specified in paragraphs (u)(3)(i) (A) and (B) of this section in accordance with the requirements
of paragraph (u)(7)(i) of this section not less than once every 12 months since the previous compliance test.
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(F) Units with a rated heat input capacity equal to or greater than 100 mmBtu/hr shall demonstrate compliance with
the NO
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=5 f=2 -->
X
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
 and CO emission standards specified in paragraphs (u)(3)(i) (A) and (B) of this section in accordance with the requirements
of paragraph (u)(6)(ii)(A) of this section.
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(ii) Any owner or operator that operates a unit with an annual heat input rate less than 9
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=6 f=1 -->
&times;
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
10
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=5 f=1 -->
9
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
 Btu/yr shall comply with one of the following:
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(A) The unit shall be tuned once every 6 months or after 750 hours of operation since the previous tuneup, whichever
occurs last, but in no case less than once per calendar year. The unit shall be tuned in accordance with the procedures
described in paragraph (u)(7)(ii) of this section; or
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(B) The unit shall be operated in a manner that maintains stack gas oxygen concentrations at less than or equal to 3 percent
on a dry basis for any 15 consecutive minute averaging period; or
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(C) The unit shall be operated using a stack gas oxygen trim system set at 3 percent oxygen. The tolerance of the setting
shall be 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=6 f=1 -->
#
