) Equipment-related limitations_such as low 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
windbox/furnace pressure differential, built in air-flow limits, 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
etc. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(F) 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
Step 6
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
. Develop an O
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

