<!-- PJG ITAG l=80 g=1 f=1 -->
&sect;52.2962 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=89 g=1 f=1 -->
Enhanced in-use compliance program for light-and 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
medium-duty vehicles. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
(a) 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
General applicability.
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(1) Every new 1999 and later model year light-duty vehicle, 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
light-duty truck, and medium-duty vehicle manufactured for sale, 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
sold, offered for sale, introduced, or delivered for introduction 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
to commerce, or imported into the State of California for sale or 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
resale shall be covered by a certificate of conformity issued 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
pursuant to paragraph (d) of this section. Medium-duty vehicles 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
whose engines are covered by a certificate of conformity 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
applicable to heavy-duty engines issued by the State of 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
California pursuant to the California Code are exempted from this 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
requirement, but must comply with the requirements of &sect;52.2966. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(2) Any manufacturer, dealer, or other person who violates 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
paragraph (a)(1) of this section shall be subject to a civil 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
penalty of not more than $25,000. Any such violation with 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
respect to paragraph (a)(1) of this section shall constitute a 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
separate offense with respect to each motor vehicle. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(3) Certain vehicle fleet operators, as defined in 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
paragraph (g) of this section, are subject to the provisions 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
contained in that paragraph. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(b) 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
Definitions and abbreviations. 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
The definitions and 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
abbreviations of 40 CFR parts 86 and 88, &sect;52.2963, and the 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
definitions contained in the Clean Air Act (42 U.S.C. 7401&hyph;7671q) 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
apply to this section unless the term is defined in this section. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
If defined in this section, the definition in this section 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
governs. 
