emission of pollutants from motor vehicles and engines set by the 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
California Air Resources Board which have received waivers from 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
the Administrator under section 209 of the Clean Air Act. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
Composite non-methane hydrocarbon emission level
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
 means the 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
combined exhaust and evaporative emission non-methane hydrocarbon 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
level, expressed in g/mi (or g/km). Conversion factors are 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
applied to measured evaporative emissions to generate the 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
composite level and measured evaporative hydrocarbon levels are 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
equated to evaporative non-methane hydrocarbon levels. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
Enhanced ILEV 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
means a vehicle for which the Administrator 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
has issued the manufacturer a certificate of conformity 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
designating the vehicle as an ILEV under 40 CFR 88.311&hyph;93 and as 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
complying with the provisions of paragraph (d) of this section. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
FIP I/M program 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
means any motor vehicle inspection and 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
maintenance program meeting the provisions of &sect;52.2963. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
Full life 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
means up to and including 100.0 percent of the 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
full useful life mileage and age. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
Half life 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
means up to and including 50.0 percent of the full 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
useful life mileage and age. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
Light-duty truck 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
 means any motor vehicle rated at 6000 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
pounds GVWR or less which is designed primarily for purposes of 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
transportation of property or is a derivative of such vehicle, or 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
is available with special features enabling off-street or off- 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
highway operation and use. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

