<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
Medium-duty vehicle 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
means any heavy-duty vehicle having a 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
GVW of 14,000 pounds or less, or any motor vehicle having a GVW 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
greater than 6000 pounds but less than 14,000 pounds. 
