<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
 emissions, as defined in paragraph 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(f)(4) of this section. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(ii) This substitution shall begin 30 days after the date 
