<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
which the submittal is due), and shall calculate the fleet 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
averaging program surcharge according to the following equation: 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG QTAG 02 -->
<!-- PJG /QTAG -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=16 g=1 f=1 -->
Surcharge=$10,000&times;(FAE^BEL&times;(Number of Affected Vehicles)
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG QTAG 02 -->
<!-- PJG /QTAG -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=10 g=1 f=1 -->
This calculation shall be performed separately for vehicles in 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
the 19,501 to 33,000 pound GVWR range, if the fleet contains any 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
such vehicles, and in the over 33,000 pound GVWR range, if the 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
fleet contains any such vehicles. If the calculated surcharge is 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
less than zero for either category of vehicles, the surcharge for 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
that category of vehicles shall be set to zero. The sum of the 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
surcharges for the two categories of vehicles shall be paid 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
concurrently with the submittal of information described in 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
paragraphs (h)(2) and (3) of this section. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG /STAG -->
</TEXT>
