<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
Equivalent Unit (PEU) control period total to determine the 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
operator's total emission quantity target for the relevant year. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(
