<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=89 g=1 f=1 -->
Locomotives. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
(a) 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
General provisions. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(1) Applicability. 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
(i) The provisions of paragraphs 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(a)(2)(i), (a)(2)(ii), (a)(2)(iii), (a)(4)(i), (a)(4)(ii) and 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(a)(4)(iii) of this section, shall apply specifically to all 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
locomotives operating in California. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(ii) The provisions of paragraphs (a)(2)(iv), (a)(2)(v), 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(a)(4)(iv), (a)(4)(v), (b), (c) and (e) of this section shall 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
apply to all locomotives located in the ``control area'' defined as 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
the South Coast Air Basin ozone nonattainment area in 40 CFR 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
81.305. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(2) 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
Compliance dates. 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
The dates for compliance with the 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
requirement of this section are as follows: 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(i) January 1, 2000 for locomotives manufactured before 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
January 1, 2000 and after January 1, 1973, and remanufactured on 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
or after January 1, 2000 for compliance with the standard in 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
paragraph (a)(4)(i) of this section. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(ii) January 1, 2000 for locomotives manufactured between 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
January 1, 2000 and December 31, 2004 at the time of manufacture 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
and at each remanufacturing on or after January 1, 2000 for 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
compliance with the standard in paragraph (a)(4)(ii) of this 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
section. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(iii) January 1, 2005 for locomotives manufactured after 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
January 1, 2005 at the time of manufacture and at each 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
remanufacturing on or after january 1, 2005 for compliance with 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
the standard in paragraph (a)(4)(iii) of this section. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(iv) January 1, 2007 for railroads operating in the control 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
area for compliance with the standard in paragraph (a)(4)(iv) of 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
this section. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(v) January 1, 2010 for railroads operating in the control 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
area for compliance with the standard in paragraph (a)(4)(v) of 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
this section. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(3) 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
Definitions. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
Administrator 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
means the Administrator of the Environmental 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
Protection Agency or his/her authorized representative. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
Engine used in a locomotive 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
means either an engine placed in 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
the locomotive to move other equipment, freight, or passenger 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
traffic, or an engine mounted on the locomotive to provide 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
auxiliary power. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
Locomotive 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
means a self-propelled piece of on-track 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
equipment (other than equipment designed for operation both on 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
highways and rails, specialized maintenance equipment, and other 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
similar equipment) designed for moving other equipment, freight, 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
or passenger traffic. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
Railroad company 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
means any company or organization that 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
operates one or more locomotives. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(4) 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
Emissions standards. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(i) NO
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=5 f=2 -->
X
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
 emissions from a locomotive manufactured before 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
January 1, 2000 and after January 1, 1973, following 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
remanufacturing on or after January 1, 2000, shall comply with a 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
standard such that the emissions from the locomotive average 8 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
g/bhp-hr or less. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(ii) NO
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=5 f=2 -->
X
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
 emissions from a locomotive manufactured on or 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
after January 1, 2000 and before January 1, 2005 shall comply 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
with a NO
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=5 f=2 -->
X
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
 standard of 6.5 g/bhp-hr. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(iii) NO
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=5 f=2 -->
X
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
 emissions from a locomotive manufactured on or 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
after January 1, 2005 shall comply with a NO
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=5 f=2 -->
X
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
 standard of 5.5 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
g/bhp-hr. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG /STAG -->
