<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(1) Average emission rate. 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
Immediately following the end of each year, each railroad company shall calculate its average emission rate in the
control area for the preceding year as follows: 
