owner, or owner group, shall compare the calculated Fleet Average 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
Emissions (FAE) with the Baseline Emission Level (BEL) in Table 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
2975&hyph;4 (for equipment in the South Coast Air Basin or in Ventura 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
County) or Table 2975&hyph;5 (for equipment in the Sacramento ozone 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
nonattainment area), applicable to the appropriate equipment class 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
and calendar year for which the calculation applies (that is, the 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
BEL for the calendar year in which the submittal is due), and shall 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
calculate the fleet averaging program surcharge according to the 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
following equation: 
