<DOC>
<DOCNO> FR940505-1-00499 </DOCNO>
<PARENT> FR940505-1-00012 </PARENT>
<TEXT>
 
<!-- PJG STAG 4702 -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
(i) The following records shall be maintained and provided 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
to the EPA upon request. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(A) Emissions monitoring and process data records necessary 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
for the determination and reporting of emissions, in accordance 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
with applicable provisions of the applicable rules and 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
regulations, shall be maintained. Records shall be kept for at 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
least five years. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(B) Other records of the nature and amounts of emissions or 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
any other information as may be deemed necessary by the EPA to 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
determine whether the stationary source or emissions unit is in 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
compliance with applicable emission limitations, credited 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
emission reductions, exemptions from rule provisions, or other 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
requirements. The information must include emission 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
measurements, continuous emission monitoring system performance 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
testing measurements, performance evaluations, calibration checks 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
and adjustments, maintenance performed on such monitoring 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
systems, and other records and reports required by 40 CFR part 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
51, appendix P, Minimum Emission Monitoring Requirements. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(C) Operation and maintenance plans shall be submitted to 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
the district for all add-on capture and control equipment for 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
review and approval by the EPA. Such plans shall demonstrate, 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
though the use of specific recordkeeping requirements, continuous 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
operation of the add-on control equipment when emission-producing 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
operations are occurring. The plan shall also specify records to 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
be kept to document the performance of required periodic 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
maintenance. Records shall be consistent with compliance time 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
frames and employ the most recent EPA recordkeeping guidance. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(D) The EPA may require monitoring or recordkeeping and may 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
authorize inspections pursuant to Section 114 of the Clean Air 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
Act and the regulations thereunder. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(E) All monitoring, reporting, inspection and compliance 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
requirements authorized under the Clean Air Act shall apply. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(ii) The EPA may require recordkeeping to verify or 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
maintain any exemption. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=80 g=1 f=1 -->
&sect;52.3001 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=89 g=1 f=1 -->
New source review (Sacramento). 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->

<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
(a) 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=3 -->
Purpose.
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

<!-- PJG ITAG l=11 g=1 f=1 -->
 The purpose of this section is to provide for 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
the review of new and modified stationary air pollution sources 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
and to provide requirements, including emission offsets, for 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
issuing Authority to Construct permits for such sources without 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
interfering with the attainment or maintenance of ambient air 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
