<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
from source shutdowns and curtailments are in accordance with the 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
most current EPA emissions trading policy and applicable federal 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
regulations; and 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(iii) Emissions decreases are ensured and documented by 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
enforceable emission limitations contained in the Authority to 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
Construct; or 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(iv) Emissions decreases are ensured by the permanent 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
surrender or cancellation of the Authority to Construct. 
<!-- PJG 0012 frnewline -->
(5) 
<!-- PJG /ITAG -->

